  "sourceTitle": "Jam Jam Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Jam Jam Cookies\nBy: Andie Mitchell\nPublished: Friday, December 11, 2009 - 11:42am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup brown sugar\n1 cup shortening\n6 tablespoons corn syrup\n2 eggs, beaten\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n4 1/2 cups flour\n2 teaspoons soda\nRaspberry jam\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Preheat the oven to 350. Combine all ingredients except jam.  2 Roll out thin and cut with a small cookie cutter. Bake until golden brown (about 8 minutes).  3 When cooled, put 2 cookies together with raspberry jam.",
